            "sid": "1CH 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kuwanu waa boqorradii u talin jiray dalka reer Edom, intaan boqorna u talin reer binu Israa'iil, Belac ina Becoor, oo magaaladiisana magaceeda waxaa la odhan jiray Dinhaabah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Belac dhintay oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday Yoobaab ina Serax oo reer Bosraah ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoobaab dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday Xushaam oo ka yimid dalka reer Teemaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Xushaam dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday Hadad ina Bedad, kaasoo Midyaan ku dilay beertii Moo'aab dhexdeeda, oo magaaladiisa magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Cawiid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Hadad dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday Samlah oo ahaa reer Masreqah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Samlah dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday Shaa'uul oo ka yimid Rexobod oo Webiga ku ag tiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Shaa'uul dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday Bacal Xaanaan ina Caqboor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Bacal Xaanaan dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii boqor ka noqday Hadad, oo isna magaaladiisu waxay ahayd Faacuu, oo naagtiisa magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Meheetabeel oo ay dhashay Matreed, iyana waxay ahayd ina Meesaahaab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadna wuu dhintay. Oo ugaasyadii reer Edomna waxay ahaayeen ugaas Timnac, iyo ugaas Calwah, iyo ugaas Yeteed, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo ugaas Aaholiibaamah, iyo ugaas Eelaah, iyo ugaas Fiinon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo ugaas Qenas, iyo ugaas Teemaan, iyo ugaas Mibsaar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo ugaas Magdii'eel, iyo ugaas Ciiraam. Intaasu waa ugaasyadii reer Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.54"
            ]
          }
        }
